rder to  avoid copyright issues and getting this  video taken down I'm going to be only  looking at stills from the PV and  close-ups of the things that I find the  most interesting of the things that we  couldn't quite tell for sure from the  lower quality PV and analyzing them of  course if you feel that I missed  something let me know in the comments  I'd love to hear your take in terms of  the most interesting details that I see  now with the higher quality PV we can  see in the scene  we're two riders are riding camels in  the sand in beside what looks like an  ancient temple with the higher quality  if we zoom in we see that this person  this first person could definitely be c2  now some people were saying this before  as well  but when we look at it now with higher  quality it definitely looks like a woman  with long green hair now the picture is  not that clear it is not up close enough  to be 100% sure but judging by the  clothes the white clothes that c2 likes  and the seemingly green hair this could  definitely be c2 behind her we don't  know who it is it's not clear to make  out but of course many people will guess  if it's c2 then it must be Lelouch right  behind her we can't know for sure but it  is very possible we also see a tipped  over cart of course in this sequence in  the scene some people have been  speculating that maybe that is the cart  from the final scene of Code Geass where  we see c2 in the cart and people are  assuming of course that Lelouch was  driving the cart  however I don't know how that cart would  end up here in the middle of nowhere in  the sand but I guess it's possible we'll  have to wait and find out another really  interesting detail is the scene where we  see Jeremiah among a whole bunch of  flamingoes in the water if we zoom in we  can now tell for sure that right beside  Jeremiah among the flamingos Anya is  also there now the very next sequence  after this Flamingo scene in the PV is  jeremiah being seemingly attacked  shocked by electricity and he is dressed  the same way and he also appears to be  outside leading us to speculate that he  could be attacked in this very scene of  course we can be sure who is actually  attacking orange but the fact that Anya  is here could lead us to speculate that  perhaps she turned on him for some  reason  could it be that Mariana is not really  dead and that she possessed her again  couldn't be that she betrayed them for  some other reason could it be that it's  just a completely different villain and  Anya being there is a coincidence we  don't know but I'd love to hear your  thoughts on this in the comments the  next interesting detail is the airport  scene where now when you zoom in we can  tell pretty much for sure that the three  people at the bottom at the airport are  Nina Millie and rebel rumors have been  going around for a while now that it was  them three in this scene but with the  low quality P V it was really in  possible to tell for sure however this  to me looks like pretty conclusive  evidence in this scene where Cornelia is  walking up to an ancient temple we can  see an ancient statue and a sword buried  in the ground we also see what appears  to be some sort of modern research team  doing some type of research at the  temple and then the very next thing that  happens in the PV is an explosion that  Cornelia witnesses again this is very  interesting that the research team  caused the explosion that someone  attacked the research team what are they  researching in the first place is that  the origins of Geass this is really  interesting to me I'm really curious  about this and I'd love to hear what you  think as well the next thing we see is  some sort of landscape beside a river  and then we jump to Suzaku apparently  jumping for his life from some sort of  high-speed railway wagon but check out  what all around Suzaku it's orange trees  just like the orange trees in the final  scenes of Code Geass r2 where orange and  Anya were working on an orange farm now  in one of my previous videos where I  talked about an image from 2009 that  appears to show a scene from Code Geass  season 3 and by the way the link to that  video is in the description I mentioned  that Lelouch and c2 are shown to be in a  landscape with a lot of sheep and I  speculated that this could be in an area  of southwestern Australia known as the  area around the Murray River and I had a  bunch of reasons for this I talked about  it in that video of course we know that  Australia is a great place to run away  in the world of Code Geass because it is  not aligned with anyone Mao wanted to  escape there back when he was trying to  escape with c2 so of course it's a great  place to run and just look at this just  look at this sequence remember the  sequence with the river right before we  jump to Suzaku running for his life  around all the orange trees check this  out and compare this with these images  of the actual murray river area of south  western australia now i know everyone  keeps saying that i'm an Australia  conspiracy theorist because I keep  claiming that Australia is going to play  a role in code geass season 3 but I mean  look at these images I feel like they  might very well be in Australia the  orange farm might be  Australia guys let me know if you agree  with me let me know what you think I'd  love to hear from you down below also if  you are new to the channel be sure to  subscribe and hit that notification bell  because here at anime uproar we will  keep you up to date for all the latest  news and updates for code geass season 3  and a whole bunch of other anime and  once again if you want to chat with us  on a daily basis and be the first to  know when a new video is coming out you  can join the discord server link in the  description as always thank you so much  for watching and until next time see ya  space cowboys  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]

